\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af494 \ltrch\fcs0 \f494\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2050113\charrsid16254365 4.1- C\'e1c c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f hi\u7879\'3fn \'f0ang tr\u7921\'3fc ti\u7871\'3fp l\'e0m c\'e1c c\'f4ng t\'e1c v\u7873\'3f qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2050113\charrsid16254365 \'fd qu\u7929\'3f Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Nh\'e0 n}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af494 \ltrch\fcs0 \f494\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2050113\charrsid16254365 \'fd\u7899\'3fc c\u7911\'3fa Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc Trung \'fd
\'f5ng, chi nh\'e1nh Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0 chuy\'ean doanh t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f, khu v\u7921\'3fc, \'f0\u7863\'3fc khu, huy\u7879\'3fn, qu\u7853\'3fn ... c\'f3 m\u7863\'3ft \'f0\u7871\'3fn cu\u7889\'3fi ng\'e0
y 31/12/1989 \'f0\'fd\u7907\'3fc b\'e0n giao \'f0\u7847\'3fy \'f0\u7911\'3f cho h\u7879\'3f th\u7889\'3fng Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc tr\u7921\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh. Nh\u7919\'3fng c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f li\'ean quan kh
\'e1c bao g\u7891\'3fm c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f l\'e0m c\'f4ng vi\u7879\'3fc: k\u7871\'3f to\'e1n, kho qu\u7929\'3f, ki\u7875\'3fm ng\'e2n, qu\u7843\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af486 \ltrch\fcs0 \f486\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2050113\charrsid16254365 \'fd ti\u7873\'3fn m
