\f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2050113\charrsid16254365 \'fd ti\u7873\'3fn l}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af494 \ltrch\fcs0 \f494\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2050113\charrsid16254365 \'fd\'f5ng khu v\u7921\'3fc h\'e0nh ch\'ednh, c\'f4ng tr\'e1i x\'e2y d\u7921\'3fng T\u7893\'3f qu\u7889
\'3fc, b\u7843\'3fo v\u7879\'3f kho t\'e0ng . . . do th\u7911\'3f tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng hai ng\'e0nh Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0 T\'e0i ch\'ednh tho\u7843\'3f thu\u7853\'3fn tr\'ean nguy\'ean t\u7855\'3fc \'f0\u7843\'3fm b\u7843\'3f
o cho Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc \'f0\u7911\'3f c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f ho\u7841\'3ft \'f0\u7897\'3fng b}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2050113\charrsid16254365 \'ecnh th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af494 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f494\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2050113\charrsid16254365 \'fd\u7901\'3fng. Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f l\u7853\'3fp danh s\'e1ch nh\u7919\'3fng c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f \'f0ang l\'e0m vi\u7879\'3fc n\'f3i tr\'ean \'f0
\u7875\'3f b\'e0n giao cho h\u7879\'3f th\u7889\'3fng kho b\u7841\'3fc, k\'e8m theo h\u7891\'3f s\'f5 c\'e1 nh\'e2n t\u7915\'3fng c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f.
\par 4.2- \'d0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng c\'e1n b\u7897\'3f h\u7871\'3ft tu\u7893\'3fi c\'f4ng t\'e1c v\u7873\'3f h\'fdu cho ngh\u7881\'3f h\'fdu ngay m\'e0 kh\'f4ng ph\u7843\'3fi b\'e0n giao.
\par 4.3- \'d0\u7889\'3fi t\'fd\u7907\'3fng c\'e1n}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2050113\charrsid16254365  b\u7897\'3f l\'e3nh }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af494 \ltrch\fcs0 \f494\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2050113\charrsid16254365 \'f0\u7841\'3fo l\'e0 c
\u7845\'3fp Gi\'e1m \'f0\u7889\'3fc chi nh\'e1nh Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng t\u7881\'3fnh, tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng ph}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2050113\charrsid16254365 \'f2ng }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af494 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f494\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2050113\charrsid16254365 \'f0\u7841\'3fi di\u7879\'3fn ph\u7909\'3f tr\'e1ch qu\u7929\'3f ng\'e2n s\'e1ch t\u7881\'3fnh v\'e0 huy\u7879\'3fn do th\u7911\'3f tr\'fd\u7903\'3fng 2 ng\'e0nh Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc, T
\'e0i ch\'ednh c\u7845\'3fp t\u7881\'3fnh b\'e0n b\u7841\'3fc th\u7889\'3fng nh\u7845\'3ft b\'e1o c\'e1o v\u7899\'3fi Ch\u7911\'3f t\u7883\'3fch U\u7927\'3f ban Nh\'e2n d\'e2n \'f0\u7883\'3fa ph\'fd\'f5ng quy\u7871\'3ft \'f0\u7883\'3fnh tr\'fd\u7899\'3f
c khi b\'e0n giao.
\par 5/ V\u7873\'3f c\'f5 s\u7903\'3f v\u7853\'3ft ch\u7845\'3ft g\u7891\'3fm nh\'e0 l\'e0m vi\u7879\'3fc v\'e0 c\'e1c ph\'fd\'f5ng ti\u7879\'3fn l\'e0m vi\u7879\'3fc b\'e0n giao cho h\u7879\'3f th\u7889\'3fng kho b\u7841\'3fc theo quy \'f0\u7883\'3fnh c\u7909
\'3f th\u7875\'3f sau \'f0\'e2y:
\par 5.1- Nh\u7919\'3fng n\'f5i tr\u7909\'3f s\u7903\'3f ho\u7863\'3fc nh\'e0 l\'e0m vi\u7879\'3fc \u7903\'3f m\u7897\'3ft khu v\u7921\'3fc ri\'eang bi\u7879\'3ft, ho\u7863\'3fc nh\u7919\'3fng n\'f5i c\'f3 \'f0i\u7873\'3fu ki\u7879\'3fn s\u7855\'3fp x\u7871
\'3fp, c\u7847\'3fn s\u7855\'3fp x\u7871\'3fp b\u7889\'3f tr\'ed n\'f5i l\'e0m vi\u7879\'3fc ri\'eang bi\u7879\'3ft, th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2050113\charrsid16254365 \'ec Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng Nh\'e0 n}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af494 
