\'3fn tr\u7909\'3f s\u7903\'3f ri\'eang th}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2050113\charrsid16254365 \'ec tr\u7843\'3f l\u7841\'3fi cho Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng Nh\'e0 n}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af494 \ltrch\fcs0 
