\par 6/ B\'e0n giao t\u7891\'3fn qu\u7929\'3f ng\'e2n s\'e1ch c\'e1c c\u7845\'3fp nh\'fd sau:
\par 6.1/ Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc t\u7881\'3fnh u\u7927\'3f nhi\u7879\'3fm cho ph}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2050113\charrsid16254365 \'f2ng }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af494 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f494\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2050113\charrsid16254365 \'f0\u7841\'3fi di\u7879\'3fn Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc t\u7881\'3fnh t\u7841\'3fi huy\u7879\'3fn, cu\u7889\'3fi ng\'e0y 31/3/1990 c\'e3n c\u7913\'3f v\'e0o s\u7889\'3f li\u7879\'3fu tr\'ea
n c\'e1c t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn thu, chi ng\'e2n s\'e1ch huy\u7879\'3fn r\'fat t\u7891\'3fn qu\u7929\'3f ng\'e2n s\'e1ch huy\u7879\'3fn cu\u7889\'3fi \'f0\u7875\'3f b\'e0n giao cho chi nh\'e1nh Kho b\u7841\'3fc s\u7917\'3f d\u7909\'3fng.
\par 6.2/ Sau khi xo\'e1 s\u7893\'3f l\'ean c\'e2n \'f0\u7889\'3fi ng\'e0y 31/3/1990 ph}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2050113\charrsid16254365 \'f2ng }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af494 \ltrch\fcs0 \f494\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2050113\charrsid16254365 \'f0
\u7841\'3fi di\u7879\'3fn huy\u7879\'3fn l\u7853\'3fp chuy\u7875\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn chuy\u7875\'3fn to\'e0n b\u7897\'3f s\u7889\'3f d\'fd c\'e1c t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn thu chi ng\'e2n s\'e1ch t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f v\'e0 s\u7889\'3f d\'fd t
\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn thu chi ng\'e2n s\'e1ch trung \'fd\'f5ng v\u7873\'3f Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f.
\par 6.3/ Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc t\u7881\'3fnh nh\u7853\'3fn c\'e1c chuy\u7875\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn thu chi Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch t\u7881\'3fnh c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c huy\u7879\'3fn chuy\u7875\'3fn v\u7873\'3f h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n v\'e0o t\'e0i kho
\u7843\'3fn thu chi ng\'e2n s\'e1ch t\u7881\'3fnh trong ng\'e0y 31/3/1990, r\'fat t\u7891\'3fn qu\u7929\'3f ng\'e2n s\'e1ch t\u7881\'3fnh \'f0\u7871\'3fn cu\u7889\'3fi ng\'e0y \'f0\u7875\'3f b\'e0n giao cho chi c\u7909\'3fc Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd
\u7899\'3fc t\u7891\'3fn qu\u7929\'3f ng\'e2n s\'e1ch t\u7881\'3fnh.
\par 6.4/ Nh\u7853\'3fn chuy\u7875\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn thu chi ng\'e2n s\'e1ch trung \'fd\'f5ng t\u7915\'3f c\'e1c huy\u7879\'3fn chuy\u7875\'3fn v\u7873\'3f, Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f h\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n v
\'e0o t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn thu chi ng\'e2n s\'e1ch trung \'fd\'f5ng tr\'ean to\'e0n t\u7881\'3fnh, r\u7891\'3fi t\u7845\'3ft to\'e1n t\u7915\'3fng t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn thu chi ng\'e2n s\'e1ch trung \'fd\'f5ng \'f0\u7875\'3f chuy\u7875\'3fn ti\u7873\'3f
n v\u7873\'3f Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng Trung \'fd\'f5ng (V\u7909\'3f qu\u7929\'3f ng\'e2n s\'e1ch).
\par 6.5/ Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc Trung \'fd\'f5ng (V\u7909\'3f qu\u7929\'3f NSNN) Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc\u7853\'3fn chuy\u7875\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn thu chi NSTW c\u7911\'3fa c\'e1c t\u7881\'3fnh chuy\u7875\'3fn v\u7873\'3f h
\u7841\'3fch to\'e1n v\'e0o c\'e1c t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn thu chi NSTW - sau \'f0\'f3 r\'fat t\u7891\'3fn qu\u7929\'3f NSTW \'f0\u7875\'3f b\'e0n giao cho C\u7909\'3fc Kho b\u7841\'3fc thu\u7897\'3fc B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch\'ednh.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2050113\charrsid16254365 6.6/ Nh\u7919\'3fng kho\u7843\'3fn thu chi Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch c\'e1c c\u7845\'3fp c\'f2n tr\'ean }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af494 \ltrch\fcs0 
