n h\'e0ng c\'f3 tr\'e1ch nhi\u7879\'3fm theo d}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2050113\charrsid16254365 \'f5i v\'e0 chuy\u7875\'3fn nh\u7853\'3fp v\'e0o t\'e0i kho\u7843\'3fn ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7917\'3fi Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af494 \ltrch\fcs0 \f494\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2050113\charrsid16254365 \'fd\u7899\'3fc v\'e0 th\'f4ng b\'e1o cho Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc bi\u7871\'3ft.
\par 7/ Ti\u7873\'3fn g\u7917\'3fi qu\u7929\'3f d\u7921\'3f tr\u7919\'3f t\'e0i ch\'ednh b\u7857\'3fng ti\u7873\'3fn (\'f0\u7891\'3fng) c\u7911\'3fa Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch c\'e1c c\u7845\'3fp s\u7889\'3f d\'fd c}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 
