\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2050113\charrsid16254365 7.2/ Qu}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af494 \ltrch\fcs0 \f494\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2050113\charrsid16254365 \u7929\'3f d\u7921\'3f tr\u7919\'3f t\'e0i ch\'ednh Ng\'e2n s\'e1ch t\u7881\'3fnh, th
\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f do Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc t\u7881\'3fnh, th\'e0nh ph\u7889\'3f chuy\u7875\'3fn giao cho Chi c\u7909\'3fc Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc.
\par 7.3/ Qu\u7929\'3f d\u7921\'3f tr\u7919\'3f t\'e0i ch\'ednh ng\'e2n s\'e1ch Trung \'fd\'f5ng do Ng\'e2n h\'e0ng Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc Trung \'fd\'f5ng chuy\u7875\'3fn giao cho C\u7909\'3fc Kho b\u7841\'3fc Nh\'e0 n\'fd\u7899\'3fc - B\u7897\'3f T\'e0i ch
\'ednh}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af0 \ltrch\fcs0 \f0\fs28\cgrid0\insrsid2050113\charrsid16254365 .
